{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0371_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "eb5c0c02e01d76fe7ba6d88e6eb9088283864445122535563ad0aac391ef5d48", "ja": "『りるきゃん』再び！", "zh": "“little candy”再临！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0371_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c9552dbfb07541f14822b1ff0a78bea02efe4b4f0789d1a53f236542bb1cce38", "ja": "以前イメージモデルを務めた『りるきゃん』\nのイベントにゲスト出演する事になった翼、\n可憐、茜の3人。原画展示や先生のサイン会\nなど様々な企画の中に『持ち込み編集部』の\n文字を見つけた茜は2人にある提案をする。", "zh": "曾担任形象模特的『りるきゃん』\n活动中，翼、可怜、茜3人将作为嘉宾出演。在原画展览、老师签名会\n等各种企划中发现了“持ち込み編集部”字样的茜，向另外2人提出了一个建议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0371_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "19312eed21e4d2ba323401933c70a180b50fc2e2a4ef6836abbf200210f1fbec", "ja": "（今日は、『りるきゃん』のイベント出演についての\nミーティング。翼、可憐、茜に集まってもらった）", "zh": "（今天是关于参加《Lil' Canvas》活动的会议。把翼、可怜和茜三人叫来了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0371_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "aa4c418f223399c716fa2ea2e5bea786ca2356191e2bf6a8b841cc7eaea01fae", "ja": "というわけで、『りるきゃん』創刊50周年記念で、\n大規模な展示会が行われることになった。", "zh": "所以，为了纪念《Lil Can》创刊50周年，将举办一场大型展览会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0371_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "51de2a904f99deb27820df4683e08eea84cc2b9f766b0f3ef3d2553a744583a2", "ja": "そのイベントに、以前イメージモデルを務めた\nみんなに、ゲスト出演してほしいそうなんだ。", "zh": "听说他们想邀请曾经担任过形象模特的大家，作为嘉宾出席那场活动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0371_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_01_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "fff37377f663b280fb0b39672613e941b822d6f2c9a8b9c9ad1b7b2fccca7ed1", "ja": "わ、私たちが、『りるきゃん』のイベントに……？", "zh": "我、我们要去参加『りるきゃん』的活动……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0371_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_01_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5f66607d6645406e7bd2c4f69e80e25355449285def19799e441b44dbf001f07", "ja": "また『りるきゃん』のお仕事ができるんですね！\nクラスのみんなに自慢しちゃお～っと♪", "zh": "又能接『Little Candy』的工作了呢！\n我要去跟同班同学好好炫耀一下～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0371_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_01_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "5ba728d31f76bf5663c6469825954c8cd0b3680906895cab9415fa5883f081e7", "ja": "いつか、こういう機会が来ると思ってたよ！\n茜ちゃん達の功績は、あまりにも大きかったからね！", "zh": "我就知道总有一天会有这样的机会！\n毕竟小茜她们立下的功绩实在是太大了嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0371_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_01_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6292fca3855911ff47637d7779f76ec228d4f0ac9dc873864252ada349d27368", "ja": "でも、少女マンガ雑誌の展示会？って、\nどんなことするんですか～？", "zh": "不过，少女漫画杂志的展览会？会进行什么活动呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0371_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "cce9babb228ba0d9ec1b0ff953b5df924429f65a972c082d3cdfa97f758636e6", "ja": "イベントの内容については、この資料を見てくれ。\n今現在予定されている内容は、こんな感じだそうだ。", "zh": "关于活动的内容，看看这份资料吧。\n目前计划中的内容，似乎就是这些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0371_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_01_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c57a28bb8e09ce1fbc79edc950abac6c50e5b440008ce48fdbbc232382e18062", "ja": "えっと～、『原画展示』に、『先生方のサイン会』？\nへ～！　あとは『先生方やゲストのステージ』……。", "zh": "那个～“原画展”，还有“老师们的签名会”？\n哦～！然后是“老师们和嘉宾的舞台活动”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0371_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_01_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "48909196f5c0f42ac2518f28d44fb376ffdc01343abf3e830e8d6d29f7186a34", "ja": "ふむふむ……『持ち込み編集部』に、\n『グッズやコミックなどの販売』もあるね！", "zh": "嗯嗯……还有“带稿编辑部”，\n以及“周边和漫画等商品的贩售”呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0371_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_01_1010_045kar", "source_sha256": "9cb1c104fb5d564d36ad055a725af2f5aab1b196dd7fbab3f15615eb62067491", "ja": "すごい……。\nも、盛りだくさんなんですね……！", "zh": "好厉害……内容、内容真丰富呢……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0371_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_01_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "80fd4f859c115a484ab37ea42621be926b0e3c83bdf251fd2a8346af33719c48", "ja": "ねえねえ、{$P$}さん。\nこの『持ち込み編集部』って、なんですか？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生。\n这个“投稿编辑部”是做什么的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0371_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "d491779104cf94745d58e0e74ed45969695f2ddba8236d7cdd12844315435b03", "ja": "編集者さんが、参加者が持ち込んだマンガをその場で\n見てくれるんだ。最近は、原作でもいいみたいだけど。", "zh": "编辑会在现场帮参加者看看他们带来的漫画。最近好像带原作也可以了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0371_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_01_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "3b3f83335f5504ecfe1cf9117621388ef00cb0ee60d81614c88e09035b83e4bf", "ja": "原作……。\nほうほう、なるほどなるほど～……？", "zh": "原作……  \n哦哦，原来如此原来如此～……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0371_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_01_1014_p", "source_sha256": "ed23d6dd459821b0b3dc506a9fd45d3c1ce4ad69ec7b415ce31b62fcc8de954f", "ja": "3人には、ゲストとしてメインの\nイベントステージに立ってもらう予定だそうだ。", "zh": "你们3个好像要作为嘉宾，\n登上主活动舞台呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0371_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_01_1015_p", "source_sha256": "fd00e5d3a240008defb3a14c42e7e2a4bf61548c610e1a88cdd6de36c085bda7", "ja": "どんなステージにしたいとか、こういう衣装が\nいいとか、3人の希望を出してみてくれ！", "zh": "想要什么样的舞台、喜欢什么样的服装之类的，都把3人的愿望提出来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0371_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_01_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "是──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0371_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_01_1017_045kar", "source_sha256": "715aad2ef968af57b84e51abc0845773b0c842281e29f8a51053b68d9e3ae177", "ja": "はい……！", "zh": "好的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0371_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_01_1018_023aka", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "是──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0371_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_01_1019_p", "source_sha256": "dda93a964110a125d7f18cbfc06b6751d0f6c7283a2ca2b7c4dbc23eacbd1fb3", "ja": "おっと、もうこんな時間か。\nそれじゃ、今日のミーティングはここまで！", "zh": "哎呀，已经这么晚了啊。\n那么，今天的会议就到这里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0371_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_01_1020_p", "source_sha256": "572b256ab744b36c4f62ad785faa7a01ade090d2c6bb1431fa8f3d08fabb10e2", "ja": "俺は別件で出るけど、ここは使ってて大丈夫だから。\nまた明日な！", "zh": "我有其他事要先走，不过你们可以继续用这里。\n明天见！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0371_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_01_1021_se", "source_sha256": "e2b679ed49b66f508294c1f48413d86b36bfd7fe992fd364ab6317491c4fef73", "ja": "バタン！", "zh": "砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0371_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_01_1022_023aka", "source_sha256": "8258fb7b529e5d599807d4b01bf7530afd80195c1bc0ecbaa27a38c0511793bc", "ja": "ねえねえ、ふたりとも！\n茜ちゃん、いいこと考えちゃった！", "zh": "喂喂，你们两个！\n小茜想到个好主意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0371_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_01_1023_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0fcce1367dc6875bdd0f26cb84d9cc700cfa54724aedb330b8d5438b12a4a357", "ja": "いいこと？　なになに？", "zh": "好事？什么什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0371_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_01_1024_023aka", "source_sha256": "bddd9afb9e60e96c8bf393e95f803ff206e88fe7005835cd0fa136d2755e8acb", "ja": "えっとね……。\nゴニョゴニョ、ゴニョゴニョ……。", "zh": "那个…… \n嘀嘀咕咕，嘀嘀咕咕……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0371_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_01_1025_016tsu", "source_sha256": "709d510d98159a4b0f13365ae390521e4baafb3021e92c147cdf543b44595dee", "ja": "えっ？　わたしたちで……！？", "zh": "诶？要由我们来……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0371_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_01_1026_045kar", "source_sha256": "e10562073077efc7b7ce1a4c905093cbea83e672cd3d598eae02811b6651054c", "ja": "ま、マンガを、作る……！？", "zh": "啥、漫画……要我们来画……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0371_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_01_1027_023aka", "source_sha256": "07e57b63609940e3d10f5fd49f863f95e512b07028cbc442d86c23ec69d50781", "ja": "そのとおり！　みんな、{$P$}ちゃん\nからもらったこの資料を、もう一度よ～く見たまえ！", "zh": "没错！大家，再好好看看{$P$}送给我们的这份资料吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0371_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_01_1028_045kar", "source_sha256": "4af1d597064d63edf8b918b6c5e5a7aa9aa7443abe3b0c756dcc4642eb3346d5", "ja": "これは……。\n『りるきゃん』の、と、投稿ページ……？", "zh": "这个是……  \n《Lilica》的、投稿页面……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0371_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_01_1029_023aka", "source_sha256": "502cc53ceb8fdb5d6f4e2f0e6382da67ca7114941d3dc74262f875b2a81876c3", "ja": "そう！　『持ち込み編集部』のところ！\n見てよほら！　賞金！", "zh": "没错！就是『带稿编辑部』那里！\n你看你看！还有奖金！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0371_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_01_1030_045kar", "source_sha256": "7acf2949c812b221842b93a567eb8c13fb3e624a16abd660a9b9d87f16624933", "ja": "えっと……に、入賞したら……\n賞金……ご、500万円……！？", "zh": "那个……要是、要是获奖的话……\n奖金……五、500万日元……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0371_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_01_1031_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4224082b4f23886faf408809aa14a3f26af840d8b7f88fff5a895443f0f9644e", "ja": "すごーい！　これだけあったら、\nほしいもの全部買えちゃう！", "zh": "好厉害！有这么多的话，\n想买的东西全都能买了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0371_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_01_1032_023aka", "source_sha256": "390917a191afccefe28c82352dee9684bda39c555a8485285dd01c77753f09a5", "ja": "何しろ500万円だからね！\nプリンに換算したら、とんでもない数になるよ！", "zh": "毕竟是500万日元嘛！换算成布丁的话，可是多得不得了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0371_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0371_story_01_1033_045kar", "source_sha256": "032fc9baad99310dac5aeebc7a4e409eb9f9a8d4d774f9390e95b74e502fa5b9", "ja": "で、でも……これって、入賞した時の賞金だよね？\nそんな簡単に、も、もらえるのかな……？", "zh": "可、可是……这是获奖时的奖金，对吧？\n真、真能这么轻易拿到吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
